# corpus/mac/tap_body_english_10 — tap EN chứa tone-key được restore (master) — không phá EN (P2-5 §2)
:config method=telex diacritic_style=new
:caps selection,field_detect,inject_vk
:app com.valvesoftware.steam field=editbox

:config method=telex diacritic_style=new english_words=master
:type "master"
:expect "matẻ"
:key Space
:expect "master "
